      {
        "@language": "en-us",
        "@value": "Tentacle Tribe will be once again at this year’s Festival des art de Saint-Sauveur as part of Les sentiers de la danse à Saint-Adèle. We will be performing excerpts of Ghost outside and it is free!  location: Parc Claude Henri-Grignon  for more  info"
